ew" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKAI, HIDEAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Fat compositions excellent in antioxidant stability, flavor and appearance which contain:  (A) a fat comprising at least 15% by weight of diglycerides;  (B) an L-ascorbic acid fatty acid ester; and  (C) a member selected from among catechin, rosemary extract, sage extract and turmeric extract.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des compositions de matières grasses excellentes du point de vue de leur stabilité aux antioxydants, de leur saveur et de leur apparence, lesquelles contiennent: (A) une matière grasse contenant au moins 15 % en poids de diglycérides; (B) un ester d'acide gras d'acide L-ascorbique; (C) un élément choisi parmi la catéchine, un extrait de romarin, un extrait de sauge et un extrait de curcuma.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>